"Enable this to use the default Place Order button on the checkout page "
"instead of showing PayPal buttons. This setting does not affect Express "
"Checkout."
msgstr ""
"Aktiver dette for at bruge standardknappen Afgiv bestilling på "
"betalingssiden i stedet for at vise PayPal-knapper. Denne indstilling "
"påvirker ikke Hurtig betaling."

